                <button-visual-state>
                  <caption>Show view explanation</caption>
                  <button-caption-font-style fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='12' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#333333' />
                </button-visual-state>
              </button>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='22900' hidden-by-user='true' id='107' type-v2='text' w='98666' x='667' y='14700'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>How to interpret this view?</run>
                <run>
It shows the behavior of customers of a certain vertical/chain (</run>
                <run italic='true'>selected Element 1) </run>
                <run>with respect to other vertical/chain </run>
                <run italic='true'>(selected Element 2) </run>
                <run>during the following month.&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true'>Example having Element 1 = Dmarts ; Element 2 = Carrefour</run>
                <run>
For example, the column of May&apos;23 will show what the Dmarts MAU of May&apos;23 did in Jun&apos;23:
- Active only in Dmarts
- Active in Dmarts and Carrefour
- Active only in Carrefour
- Inactive in Dmarts or Carrefour, but active in QC
- Inactive in QC*, but active in Food
- Inactive in Food, but active in Courier
- Inactive in Platform
</run>
                <run fontsize='8'>* Doing an exception of counting Courier outside QC for analytical purposes.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='207' h='21500' hidden-by-user='true' id='75' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/DM __ LS cannibalization_ driver tree (5).jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98666' x='667' y='9000'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone h='84500' id='21' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='14700'>
              <zone h='84500' id='19' type-v2='layout-basic' w='98666' x='667' y='14700'>
                <zone h='75455' id='7' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98666' x='667' y='23745'>
